===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|spīse}}, {{inh|de|goh|spīsa}}. Derived from {{der|de|LL.|spēsa}}. Cognate with {{cog|it|spesa||expenditure, expenses}}.<ref>{{R:Kluge 1891|Speise}}</ref>

